                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \nu \colon (s,\lambda)(s,\lambda) \Rightarrow (s,\lambda)
                  which correspond to two 2-morpisms in
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi A
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
                  = succeed "," do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
