          %h2#examples Examples
          %h3#products_distributing_over_coproducts Products distributing over coproducts
          %p
            In a
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/distributive+category"} distributive category
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/products"} products
            distribute over
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coproducts"} coproducts
          %h3#in_cat In Cat
          %ul
            %li
              There is a distributive law of the monad (on
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Set"} Set
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoids"} monoids
              over the monad for
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelian+groups"} abelian groups
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rings"} rings
          %h4#tensor_products_distributing_over_direct_sums Tensor products distributing over direct sums
          %p
            For many standard choices of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+products"} tensor products
            in the presence of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/direct+sums"} direct sums
            the former distribute over the latter. See at
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+product+of+abelian+groups"} tensor product of abelian groups
            and
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+product+of+modules"} tensor product of modules
          %h3#in_other_2categories In other 2-categories
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+factorization+systems"} strict factorization systems
                can be identified with distributive laws between categories regarded as monads in
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/span"} Span(Set)
            %li
              %p
                More generally,
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/factorization+systems+over+a+subcategory"} factorization systems over a subcategory
                can be identified with distributive laws in
                = succeed "." do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Prof"} Prof
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orthogonal+factorization+systems"} orthogonal factorization systems
                are a special case. The latter can also be obtained by other weakenings; see for instance
                = succeed "." do
                  %a{:href => "http://golem.ph.utexas.edu/category/2010/07/ternary_factorization_systems.html"} this discussion
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/weak+distributive+law"} weak distributive law
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/iterated+distributive+law"} iterated distributive law
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/wreath"} wreath
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/distributivity+for+monoidal+structures"} distributivity for monoidal structures
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monad+transformer"} monad transformer
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pseudo-distributive+law"} pseudo-distributive law
          %h2#Literature Literature
          %ul
            %li#Beck69
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jon+Beck"}> Jon Beck
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Distributive Laws
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Seminar+on+Triples+and+Categorical+Homology+Theory"} Seminar on Triples and Categorical Homology Theory
                %strong 18
                (2008) 1-303 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/reprints/articles/18/tr18abs.html"}> TAC:18
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/reprints/articles/18/tr18.pdf#page=95"} pdf
            %li#vanOsdol73
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Donovan+van+Osdol"}> Donovan van Osdol
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Bicohomology Theory
                %strong 183
                (1973) 449-476 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/1996479"}> jstor:1996479
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#Street72
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ross+Street"}> Ross Street
                , §6 of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The formal theory of monads
                %strong 2
                2 (1972) 149-168 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0022-4049(72)90019-9"}> doi:10.1016/0022-4049(72)90019-9
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#BarrWells85
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Barr"}> Michael Barr
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Charles+Wells"} Charles Wells
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Toposes%2C+Triples%2C+and+Theories"} Toposes, Triples, and Theories
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/TAC+reprints+series"} Reprints in Theory and Applications of Categories
                %strong 12
                (2005) 1-287 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/reprints/articles/12/tr12abs.html"}> tac:tr12
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/reprints/articles/12/tr12abs.html"} tac:tr12
            %li#BrookesVanStone93
              %p
